{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1381574,\"title\":\"Black and White Rounded\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"When a new homeowner uncovers a hidden fortune while renovating a villa, police investigate its origins and discover that the former owner, Bai Guowei, recently died in a fall. As they delve deeper, a string of bizarre crimes begins to unravel, revealing shocking truths. This sparks a fierce confrontation between law enforcement and criminal elements, leading to an intense battle between justice and corruption.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oc9xxOKJeiTPW5FgzbNavB2n5Dn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVEiaa80EoHzwHxd7kmusaPCVwe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":78,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"黄征化\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5036609,\"name\":\"黄征化\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2408613,\"name\":\"Li Xianshi\",\"character\":\"He Fei\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/giD42kLyZM3ulNsNpxPRyqPZWOU.jpg\"},{\"id\":2040680,\"name\":\"Gao Lancun\",\"character\":\"Public Security Bureau Chief\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cf9enFwJQq77rMaXc2dQ5uOjvDb.jpg\"},{\"id\":2448081,\"name\":\"Miao Haojun\",\"character\":\"Ma Deli\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eMCk1f6OmKvjG78A5HGHMO4TYOT.jpg\"},{\"id\":2947999,\"name\":\"Cao Qi\",\"character\":\"Xia Jingjing\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/97CvZuOAm8goOozxM7lh78JQgpA.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":509467,\"title\":\"The Vanished\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lTo5AEHuZwTjrn9Sk5quioEP7FS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3OgVzd06puEx9KD68T5zzFTrdt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A detective investigates the disappearance of a woman's corpse from a morgue and