t fears are realized as her daughter becomes the next target. Determined to protect her family, Sidney must face the horrors of her past to put an end to the bloodshed once and for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":546554,\"title\":\"Knives Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pThyQovXQrw2m0s9x82twj48Jq4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4HWAQu28e2yaWrtupFPGFkdNU7V.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When renowned crime novelist Harlan Thrombey is found dead at his estate just after his 85th birthday, the inquisitive and debonair Detective Benoit Blanc is mysteriously enlisted to investigate. From Harlan's dysfunctional family to his devoted staff, Blanc sifts through a web of red herrings and self-serving lies to uncover the truth behind Harlan's untimely death.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1301421,\"title\":\"The Sheep Detectives\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKy5460GdsoknM8ppmGlJbKxAKa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6uEVedSBXsZ3QuXKP4WDCeSsOy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"George Hardy is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can't possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236153,\"title\":\"Mercy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pyok1kZJCfyuFapYXzHcy7BLlQa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIClklFGYBe0uiOoiP2vtocJbss.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the near future, a detective stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has ninety minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced AI Judge he once championed, before it determines his fate.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":176,\"title\":\"Saw\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4da0TS3iQ1IzuyhDS8elgkmOfrN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ok4ot3YbfDYZcINXf91JUfq3maB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two men wake up to find themselves shackled in a grimy, abandoned bathroom. As they struggle to comprehend their predicament, they discover a disturbing tape left behind by the sadistic mastermind known as Jigsaw. With a chilling voice and cryptic instructions, Jigsaw informs them that they must partake in a gruesome game in order to secure their freedom.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1949,\"title\":\"Zodiac\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3zCPI4JFc54xvLaJ71oI2KoP3az.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police conduct a manhunt for the Zodiac Killer, a serial killer who terrorized the San Francisco Bay Area during the late 1960s and early 1970s, taunting police with letters, bloodstained clothing, and ciphers mailed to newspapers.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":661374,\"title\":\"Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vDGr1YdrlfbU9wxTOdpf3zChmv9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y3uOfZAYwLkbvhunswBCskNMrfI.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"World-famous detective Benoit Blanc heads to Greece to peel back the layers of a mystery surrounding a tech billionaire and his eclectic crew of friends.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":915935,\"title\":\"Anatomy of a Fall\",\"post